    "title": "Two people injured after car goes over embankment - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Grace Koennecke ,\n12 hours ago MILTON, W.Va. (WSAZ) - Two people were injured after being entrapped in a car following a crash in Milton Tuesday afternoon, according to the Milton Volunteer Fire Department. Firefighters say they received an alarm for a car wreck involving entrapped occupants in the area of Prichard Road and Newmans Branch Road in Milton Tuesday afternoon. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
